#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "About the game"
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Easter morning: eggs tumble over the meadow. Catch them in your basket, "
"bank them at the cart before the bell, and dodge mud clods and bees. A "
"voice can call out every drop."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Easter morning: eggs tumble over the meadow."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Catch them in your basket, bank them at the cart before the bell, and dodge "
"mud clods and bees."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "A voice can call out every drop."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "The meadow and your lanes"
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"The meadow is a row of lanes, numbered from 1 on the far left. The first "
"rounds have three lanes, then four, then five. Left and Right arrows move "
"you one lane at a time. Each step says your lane. At either edge you bump "
"the fence."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "The meadow is a row of lanes, numbered from 1 on the far left."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "The first rounds have three lanes, then four, then five."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Left and Right arrows move you one lane at a time."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Each step says your lane."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "At either edge you bump the fence."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"You hear the meadow from your own lane: a drop straight ahead is in your "
"lane, one a little to the left is one lane left, and one far to the left is "
"further."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "The cart"
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"The cart sits at one edge: left on odd rounds, right on even, in the weekly "
"marathon too. Endless, daily, festival, and practice keep it on the left. "
"Tab locates the cart and says how far away it is."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"The cart sits at one edge: left on odd rounds, right on even, in the weekly "
"marathon too."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Endless, daily, festival, and practice keep it on the left."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Tab locates the cart and says how far away it is."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Space banks your basket when you stand in the cart's lane. The eggs roll "
"into the cart and become points. Banking anywhere else says where the cart "
"is."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Space banks your basket when you stand in the cart's lane."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "The eggs roll into the cart and become points."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Banking anywhere else says where the cart is."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "What falls"
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Each falling object is heard from its lane. Its cue changes as it "
"approaches the ground. Every drop gives you at least 1.6 seconds of "
"warning, enough to cross the whole meadow."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Each falling object is heard from its lane."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Its cue changes as it approaches the ground."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Every drop gives you at least 1.6 seconds of warning, enough to cross the "
"whole meadow."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Be in an egg's lane when it lands to catch it. Miss it and it breaks."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Be in an egg's lane when it lands to catch it."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Miss it and it breaks."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "A golden egg is worth five eggs."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"A mud clod spoils every egg in your basket if you catch it. Move out of its "
"lane."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "A mud clod spoils every egg in your basket if you catch it."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Move out of its lane."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "A bee breaks a basket if it hits you. Move out of its lane."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "A bee breaks a basket if it hits you."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"The first time you meet each of them, the game stops and explains it before "
"it falls."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "The basket"
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"The basket holds four eggs in the first rounds, five from round 3, and six "
"in the last two. The game signals when the basket is full. An egg that "
"lands in a full basket bounces out and cracks, so bank before it fills up "
"again."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"The basket holds four eggs in the first rounds, five from round 3, and six "
"in the last two."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "The game signals when the basket is full."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"An egg that lands in a full basket bounces out and cracks, so bank before "
"it fills up again."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Points and streaks"
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"An egg is worth 10 points and a golden egg 50. Every egg caught in a row "
"adds a tenth to the next one's value, up to double after a streak of ten. A "
"cracked egg, mud in the basket or a sting breaks the streak. Banking a full "
"basket earns 25 more. Clearing a round earns 50 times the round number, and "
"100 more if no egg cracked."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "An egg is worth 10 points and a golden egg 50."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Every egg caught in a row adds a tenth to the next one's value, up to "
"double after a streak of ten."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "A cracked egg, mud in the basket or a sting breaks the streak."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Banking a full basket earns 25 more."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Clearing a round earns 50 times the round number, and 100 more if no egg "
"cracked."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Spoken call-outs is a row in Settings, from the title or from the pause "
"menu during a run. Play a whole run with it off, and everything you bank is "
"worth a tenth more. Switching it on during a run ends the bonus for that "
"run."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Spoken call-outs is a row in Settings, from the title or from the pause "
"menu during a run."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Play a whole run with it off, and everything you bank is worth a tenth more."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Switching it on during a run ends the bonus for that run."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Rounds and the clock"
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid ""
"Each round opens with its announcement, then \"Go\". Nothing falls until the "
"announcement has had time to be read. Space starts the round sooner. Play "
"pauses while a page is open, such as a first-time explanation or a round's "
"summary. Only Enter continues play, so a late Space press cannot skip it. "
"Each round has a clock. Warnings mark ten seconds left and each of the last "
"five seconds. When time runs out, eggs still in your basket are lost."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Each round opens with its announcement, then \"Go\"."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Nothing falls until the announcement has had time to be read."
msgstr ""

#: games/basket-run/help.md
msgid "Space starts the round sooner."
msgstr ""

