#: games/dragon-dance/help.md
msgid "Stars and the streets"
msgstr ""

#: games/dragon-dance/help.md
msgid ""
"The parade has 8 streets, from Market Row to The Grand Avenue. Each is "
"faster and wider than the one before: Market Row has 3 lanes and no "
"firecrackers, The Grand Avenue has 5 lanes and quick drums. At the end of a "
"street you earn stars by your share of the best score the street allows: 35 "
"percent for 1 star, 60 percent for 2, and 80 percent for 3. 1 star opens "
"the next street. Play takes you to the next street without a star. Street "
"select lists every street with your stars, and locked streets say what "
"opens them."
msgstr ""

