#: games/dragon-dance/help.md
msgid "Lunar New Year on the real calendar"
msgstr ""

#: games/dragon-dance/help.md
msgid ""
"The parade follows the real calendar. The year's animal follows the lunar "
"year, which turns on Lunar New Year, so in January and early February it is "
"still last year's animal. In the 10 days before Lunar New Year, lanterns go "
"up over the shops and red envelopes count double. Lunar New Year dates are "
"known from 2024 to 2040. After 2040 the festival days do not open, and the "
"New Year parade and Lantern walk rows say so."
msgstr ""

