msgstr ""

#: games/dragon-dance/help.md
msgid "The New Year parade"
msgstr ""

#: games/dragon-dance/help.md
msgid ""
"On Lunar New Year, and the day either side of it for time zones, the New "
"Year parade opens on the title. On other days its row is locked and says "
"how many days are left. The year's animal greets you with a line as the "
"parade begins. It is a long street of 4 lanes with many red envelopes. It "
"ends with a countdown from 5 to midnight, then the great gong: rear up on "
"it for double points."
msgstr ""

