#: games/firefly-meadow/help.md
msgid "Status and hints"
msgstr ""

#: games/firefly-meadow/help.md
msgid ""
"S gives the status, always in this order: in a challenge the time left, "
"then your jar, and the nearest glow or \"a firefly in reach\". On a winter "
"walk it gives the memories found instead of the jar. Press S again straight "
"away for the fireflies caught tonight, their species, the time so far and "
"the meadow. R repeats the last thing said. H names the way to the nearest "
"glow."
msgstr ""

