#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
msgid ""
"The Left and Right arrows step you one board along the approach, and name "
"your board."
msgstr ""

#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
msgid ""
"The Up arrow turns your aim one step right. The Down arrow turns your aim "
"one step left. Each step moves the ball's line one board at the pins. The "
"aim cue marks where a clean ball would cross the pins. The game also names "
"that board."
msgstr ""

#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
msgid "The Up arrow turns your aim one step right."
msgstr ""

#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
