#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
msgid "Each step moves the ball's line one board at the pins."
msgstr ""

#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
msgid "The aim cue marks where a clean ball would cross the pins."
msgstr ""

#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
msgid "The game also names that board."
msgstr ""

#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
msgid "The pocket"
msgstr ""

#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
msgid ""
"Stand off centre and angle into the pocket. The pocket is beside the head "
"pin, about board 17 or board 23. A ball rolled straight at the head pin "
"hits it full and often leaves a split, such as the 4, 6, 7 and 10. A ball "
"that comes in at an angle, from board 12 aiming 5 right or board 28 aiming "
"5 left, carries the pins best. Miss the pocket by a board or two and a "
"single pin is often left. Even a perfect ball does not always strike: the "
"lane and the pins add a little chance to every ball."
msgstr ""

#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
msgid "Stand off centre and angle into the pocket."
msgstr ""

#: games/midnight-lanes/help.md
msgid "The pocket is beside the head pin, about board 17 or board 23."
msgstr ""

