#: games/riverboat-dice/help.md
msgid ""
"Play five landings of dice against three passengers. During each landing, "
"the dealer rolls two dice for everyone still seated. Each roll adds to the "
"table total. Tab banks what the table holds. Space stays in for another "
"roll. A 1 on either die ends the landing, and everyone still seated gets "
"nothing. Highest banked total wins. Nothing is timed."
msgstr ""

#: games/riverboat-dice/help.md
msgid "Play five landings of dice against three passengers."
msgstr ""

#: games/riverboat-dice/help.md
msgid ""
"During each landing, the dealer rolls two dice for everyone still seated."
msgstr ""

#: games/riverboat-dice/help.md
msgid "Each roll adds to the table total."
msgstr ""

#: games/riverboat-dice/help.md
msgid "Tab banks what the table holds."
msgstr ""

#: games/riverboat-dice/help.md
msgid "Space stays in for another roll."
msgstr ""

