#: games/riverboat-dice/help.md
msgid ""
"Showboat Saturday: on the second Saturday of every month, the Showboat "
"Saturday row after Play opens. On other days it stays in its place, locked, "
"and says when it opens. It is a saloon night of 5 landings against the same "
"three passengers, with one change: doubles with no 1, from 2 and 2 up to 6 "
"and 6, double what the table holds. The dealer announces the doubles, such "
"as \"Showboat doubles. The table doubles to 24.\" The passengers keep their "
"rules. Up gives the odds with the doubles in, and the careful player's hint "
"stays in until the table holds 40. It is scored on a board of its own, and "
"Records show your best. Once the day is over, Play again on the results "
"says Showboat Saturday is over and takes you back to the title."
msgstr ""

