#: games/snowfall-skate/help.md
msgid "Lanterns and your line"
msgstr ""

#: games/snowfall-skate/help.md
msgid ""
"A lantern lights a little way ahead of you and comes closer until it "
"passes. Be in its lane as it passes to take it. A lantern you miss goes by, "
"and your line starts again."
msgstr ""

