"When a trip ends, the game reads what you gathered, your score and what is "
"new in your aquarium, all on one page. Then a short menu offers Play again, "
"Hear the results again, Your aquarium, and Back to the title. After a "
"challenge, Play again becomes Play this challenge again, and the last row "
"is Back to the challenges. Escape does the same as the last row."
